From 9bfb641793af0911c52bf2902c980854b74c81d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:49:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bigger TPS accel enrichment with a cold engine, coolant
 temperature curve (pro-style)

New curve tpsAccelCltBins/tpsAccelCltMult (default 1.0, no change) multiplies the
additive TPS accel enrichment. Decel enleanment is not changed. Failed coolant sensor:
no change. Also hide Fuel by gear when injection is off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkhsyMr5ndz2MBCxuDZhPC
---
 .../controllers/algo/accel_enrichment.cpp     | 19 +++++++
 firmware/controllers/algo/accel_enrichment.h  |  3 ++
 .../algo/defaults/default_fuel.cpp            |  3 ++
 firmware/controllers/algo/tps_accel_state.txt |  1 +
 firmware/integration/rusefi_config.txt        |  5 ++
 firmware/tunerstudio/top_level_menu.ini       |  2 +-
